IDEAS DIRECTORY (tam-ring)

This folder keeps track of design, ergonomics, and architectural ideas
gathered from upstream and peer projects -- both good ideas to adopt or
adapt and ideas or patterns to intentionally avoid under the Tamlinux
philosophy (pure C11, minimal dependencies, libtam-only linkage, and
first-class Linux virtual console support).

Each file in this directory documents one reference project:

- What the project is, its developers, license, implementation language(s),
  and where its source code can be found.
- Well-organized notes on ideas we borrow, ideas we adapt, and ideas we
  avoid.
